 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nHollandse Precisie BV                                  MASTER SERVICES\nKeizersgracht 12, 3011 AA Rotterdam, Netherlands      AGREEMENT\nBTW-nummer: NL504376603B01\n\nFROM                                                         FACTUURADRES\nHollandse Precisie BV                                       Van Dijk Handel BV\nKeizersgracht 12                                            Industrieweg 88\n3011 AA Rotterdam                                           3011 AA Rotterdam\nNetherlands                                                 Netherlands\nVAT: NL504376603B01\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 23-02-2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and\nbetween Hollandse Precisie BV, with its registered office at Keizersgracht 12, Rotterdam (\"Party A\"), and Van Dijk Handel\nBV, with its registered office at Industrieweg 88, Rotterdam (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 24 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in\naccordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the\npurposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of Switzerland.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A   Hollandse Precisie BV / Jan de Vries\nParty B   Van Dijk Handel BV / Emma Bakker\nDate      23-02-2026",
